//! The protobuf wire types generated code touches
//! (`baml_bridge.cffi.v1`). An implementation detail of the
//! generated-SDK ↔ runtime boundary, not a public API.
//!
//! `baml_bridge.cffi.v1.rs` is vendored prost output, committed so the
//! published crate needs neither protoc nor the engine-coupled
//! `bridge_ctypes` crate. It is regenerated by `cargo build -p
//! bridge_ctypes` (whose build script writes it here — see
//! `crates/bridge_ctypes/README.md`), and the proto-sync CI job fails on
//! drift.

// Lints waived for generated code (`bridge_ctypes` waives the same set on
// its copy of this module): prost renders the .proto comments verbatim and
// emits unit messages as braced structs.
#![expect(clippy::doc_markdown, clippy::empty_structs_with_brackets)]

include!("baml_bridge.cffi.v1.rs");
